{"headword":"תָּפַשׂ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> lay hold of, wield <strong>(</strong>= NH <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּפַשׂ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּפַס</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּפַשׂ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּפַס</span><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.13\">2 K 14:13</a> +, sf. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּתְפָשָׂהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:28\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.28\">Dt 22:28</a>, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְפּשֹׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.6\">Is 3:6</a>, 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִתְפְשֵׂם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.12\">2 K 7:12</a>, etc.; Imv. mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּפְשׂוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:40\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.40\">1 K 18:40</a>, etc.; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּפשֹׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 34:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.34.3\">Je 34:3</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּפשֹׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 14:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.14.5\">Ez 14:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לִתְפּשֹׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.16\">21:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.21\">30:21</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְתָפְשָׂהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.19\">Dt 20:19</a>, etc.; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּפֵשׂ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:21\" href=\"/Genesis.4.21\">Gn 4:21</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּפְשִׂי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.16\">Je 49:16</a> (Ges<sup>§ 90 1</sup>), etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>lay hold of, seize</em> (with the hand), acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:12\" href=\"/Genesis.39.12\">Gn 39:12</a> (J; + <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּבִגְדוֹ</span>), ב pers. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.6\">Is 3:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.19\"